# Genuine Quickstart with its four original citizens. One synthetic 8x6 furnished canvas room
# is adopted through the ordinary housing API as a one-credit tent. Three actual bedrolls prove
# that capped extra bunks still affect privacy. All room mutations occur without advancing time;
# detached fixture objects remain retained, and a borrowed original citizen is restored exactly.
# The four founders consume the single credit: arrivals must remain Full while roof exists,
# and NoRoofAtAll when it is lost. Extra bunks never bypass capacity or founder priority.
# Shared-hall cases use a synthetic whole-building designation over native cells, then restore
# the adopted room and prove its original benefit reading. This does not prove paid architecture or cold load.
DESCRIPTION=real adopted room privacy reacts to spare bunks, doors, blocked floor, wall and bed loss, repair and a citizen occupant
REQUEST=founding-first-city
SCRIPT=quickstart-lifecycle dunes yes;stagedigest;lodging-room-native;stagedigest
VERBS=lodging-room-native
EXPECT=QUICKSTART-BOOT-BEGIN:OK,QUICKSTART-BOOT-OBSERVED:OK,QUICKSTART-BOOT-COMPLETE:OK,QUICKSTART-BUILD-BEGIN:OK,QUICKSTART-BUILD-QUOTE:OK,QUICKSTART-BUILD-CANPAY:OK,QUICKSTART-BUILD-COMMISSION:OK,QUICKSTART-LIFECYCLE-PROFILE:OK,QUICKSTART-BUILD-COMPLETE:OK~commissioned=true,stagedigest:OK~founded=true,room-shared-capped:OK~quarters=Close,room-private-room:OK~quarters=Private,room-open-door:OK~quarters=Private,room-closed-door:OK~quarters=Private,room-locked-door:OK~arrival=False,room-unlocked-door:OK~quarters=Private,room-chair-in-door:OK~quarters=Packed,room-door-cleared:OK~quarters=Private,room-bed-isolated:OK~quarters=Packed,room-bed-access-restored:OK~quarters=Private,room-solid-cabinet:OK~floor=21,room-cabinet-removed:OK~quarters=Private,room-furnished-floor:OK~quarters=Roomed,room-floor-restored:OK~quarters=Private,room-wall-loss:OK~arrival=False,room-wall-restored:OK~quarters=Private,room-bed-loss:OK~arrival=False,room-bed-restored:OK~quarters=Private,room-occupied-room:OK~quarters=Private,room-bunks-restored:OK~quarters=Close,room-hall-connected:OK~quarters=Private,room-hall-furniture-blocked:OK~quarters=Packed,room-hall-alternate-exit:OK~quarters=Private,room-hall-alternate-obstructed:OK~quarters=Packed,room-hall-route-restored:OK~quarters=Private,room-hall-exterior-locked:OK~quarters=Packed,room-hall-exterior-unlocked:OK~quarters=Private,room-hall-partitions-restored:OK~quarters=Close,lodging-room-native:OK~cases=28 passed=28 failed=0,stagedigest:OK~founded=true,COMPLETE
SET=growth,housing,native-regression
TIMEOUT=900
